    "client/protocol/Manifest.cs: only RouteKind and RouteCandidate are kept (src/MuxiP2P.Protocol/Routes.cs).",
    "New cross-platform project files (net9.0); the agent publishes for win-x64 and linux-x64.",
    "Deployment-specific addresses removed: the agent has no default reflector (--reflector / MUXI_REFLECTOR), the signaling relay host has no default (BMC_TUNNEL_RELAY_HOST), and addresses in comments and tests are documentation or public example addresses."
